43,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[37,304][1043,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Protein-Packed Vegetarian Breakfasts" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,341][812,394]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Starting your day with a protein-rich vegetarian breakfast can help keep you full and energized until lunch. Protein is essential for stabilizing energy levels and preventing mid-morning cravings. Options range from savory scrambles and burritos to sweet smoothie bowls and oatmeal, all packed with plant-based power." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,410][1006,722]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="Helpful Tips for a High-Protein Start" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,748][711,795]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="• Incorporate Tofu and Tempeh: These soy-based products are excellent sources of protein and can be scrambled like eggs or added to hashes." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,821][1006,947]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="• Lean on Legumes: Beans and lentils are packed with protein and fiber. Add them to breakfast burritos, hashes, or even savory toast." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,963][1006,1089]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="• Nut and Seed Power: Sprinkle nuts and seeds like chia, hemp, or pumpkin seeds on oatmeal, yogurt, or smoothies for an easy protein boost. Nut butters are also a great addition." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1105][1006,1273]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="• Choose High-Protein Grains: Opt for quinoa or oats in your morning porridge or breakfast bowls for a solid protein and fiber combination." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1289][1006,1415]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="7" text="• Dairy or Dairy Alternatives: Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, and soy milk can significantly increase the protein content of your breakfast." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1431][1006,1557]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="8" text="Savory and Sweet Breakfast Ideas" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1583][681,1630]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Tofu Scramble" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1656][334,1703]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="10" text="A versatile and popular choice, tofu scramble is a fantastic egg-free alternative." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1729][1006,1825]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="11" text="• Crumble firm or extra-firm tofu and sauté it with your favorite vegetables like spinach, mushrooms, and onions." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1851][1006,1935]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="12" text="• Add spices like turmeric for color, nutritional yeast for a cheesy flavor, and black salt (kala namak) for an eggy taste." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1951][1006,2035]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="13" text="• Serve with whole-wheat toast or wrap it in a tortilla for a breakfast burrito." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,2051][1006,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,278]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="GenUICraft" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[432,167][647,220]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Debug" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[829,179][900,209]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node NAF="true" in